ered by chance in 1954 by its owner, Roger Constant [1]. Apart from a Neanderthal skeleton discovered in 1957, excavator Eugène Bonifay found a large number of brown bear bones, several pits and stone platforms that contained bear bones [1].''"}]'::jsonb),
