ouse of the Arrephoroi but the evidence is still circumstantial that this was in fact the residence of the Arrephoroi [1]. The dimensions of the building are 12.2 m square, and it was erected on a foundation of limestone blocks [1]. The terrace immediately around the building is an artificial one created by infill, which along with the foundation is dated to the last half of the 5th century or contemporary with the Erechtheion [1].''"}]'::jsonb),
