    ('525dac17-d918-4dd5-9f58-6bc00715525e'::uuid, 'total_power', '30', '29', 'card-stats-2026-09-23-rollback:525dac17-d918-4dd5-9f58-6bc00715525e:total_power', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-09-23: total_power ''29'' restored on Carwynnen Quoit', 'caa43dc9b78b02366f15673543480165', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "total_power = 30 from antiquity + fortification + cultural_influence + mystery + legacy = 7 + 8 + 8 + 6 + 1"}, {"source": "production export d65d0c3df8f22029 (2026-09-25 12:21:51.637605+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 2888 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 60048 cells"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:29127", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase3:batch-0243:chunk-0001: period_start ''-4500'' -> ''-3000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:30398", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-22_mechanical-period-name: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}]'::jsonb),
    ('5281654c-51d5-443c-9a00-9824f323f61b'::uuid, 'antiquity', '4', '3', 'card-stats-2026-09-23-rollback:5281654c-51d5-443c-9a00-9824f323f61b:antiquity', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-09-23: antiquity ''3'' restored on Borremose', '777d24ad48f14f9e60e9922262f01727', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "antiquity = 4 from period_start -400"}, {"source": "production export d65d0c3df8f22029 (2026-09-25 12:21:51.637605+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 2888 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 60048 cells"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:29570", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase3:batch-0308:chunk-0001: period_start ''1'' -> ''-400''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:30399", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-22_mechanical-period-name: period_name ''1 - 500 AD'' -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:34525", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-0030:chunk-0001: description ''Borremose is a raised bog in Himmerland, Denmark, famous for a Pre-Roman Iron Age fortified settlement and three naturally mummified bog bodies discovered between 1946 and 1948. The settlement, built in the 4th century BC, comprised a 140 x 90 m gravel bank enclosed by a 450 m long moat and connected to dry land by a 150 m cobbled road, housing up to 20 longhouses at its peak. The three bog bodies date to approximately 840-160 BC and are among the best-preserved prehistoric human remains from Northern Europe. Borremose was long the only known Iron Age fortified settlement in Scandinavia.'' -> ''Borremose is a raised bog in central Himmerland, Denmark south east of the town of Aars [1]. Borremose is known for and identified with a former fortified settlement dating from the Pre-Roman Iron Age (400-100 BC)  [1]. It was constructed during the 4th century BC, as one of the largest structures of its kind in Northern Europe, but was already abandoned during the 2nd century BC, when the houses were burned down and the whole site levelled to the ground [1]. The fortified settlement of Borremose comprised a 140 x 90 m gravel bank surrounded by a moat with earth mounds on the inner side and connected to dry land by a 150 metres artificial cobbled road [1]. At least four bog bodies have been found at Borremose [1]. Three well-documented bodies were recovered during postwar peat cutting, one each in 1946, 1947 and 1948 [1]. Borremose Man was discovered in May 1946 in the southern part of the bog, about 0.5 m below the surface and beneath a layer of birch branches [1].''"}]'::jsonb),
