nd has a large fire spot in the middle [1]. In the south-west of the chamber a short aisle branches off to the right and leads to an unusually well-preserved staircase in the wall [1]. Finds included saddle and rotary querns, a potential stone ''lamp'' and several sherds of coarse pottery [1].\""}]'::jsonb),
