ch depict ships, the 4.13 m long and 0.6 m high Brandskogsskeppet stands out [1]. The unparalleled, naturalistically depicted, compact hull is decorated at the ends with the heads of moose [1]. The crew consists of six rowers [1]. This image is dated to the beginning of the Iron Age [1].''"}]'::jsonb),
