6 [1]. The thirty metopes of the treasury are 67 cm tall and 62–64 cm wide depicting the labors of Theseus and Herakles [1]. The Athenian Treasury in Delphi was built according to a typical distyle in antis design, with two antae framing two columns [1].''"}]'::jsonb),
