mposing buildings [1]. Residential areas are grouped around an agora, which is across from a theater built into the lower slope [1]. In archaic times the city was an unimportant settlement at the southern periphery of the Cyclades [1]. It was founded by Doric colonists from Sparta [1]. Inscriptions from the city''s beginnings found at the sanctuary on the spur of the mountain ridge are noteworthy [1]. They date from the transition from the 9th to the 8th century BC and are thus among the oldest known examples of the use of the Greek alphabet [1].\""}]'::jsonb),
