utskirts of Konjic [1]. The Konjic site is atypical as its floor level is at ground level [1]. The mithraic relief of Konjic, carved in gray limestone, is two-sided relief, and it shows a Tauroctony in one side and a ritual meal in the other [1].''"}]'::jsonb),
